@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EDF5F3
skinparam classBorderColor #42697A
skinparam ArrowColor #42697A
hide empty members
title Code - Native producer protocol
class "Connection" as Connection <<struct>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/native/aura-capture/src/main.rs#L26]] {
  url
  token
}
class "Source" as Source <<struct>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/native/aura-capture/src/main.rs#L31]] {
  name
  track
}
class "Init" as Init <<struct>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/native/aura-capture/src/main.rs#L36]] {
  version
  connection
  session_id
  directory
  sources
  input_pcm
  stop_after_ms
}
class "Manifest" as Manifest <<struct>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/native/aura-capture/src/main.rs#L48]] {
  version
  producer_id
  tracks
  base_sequence
}
class "Capture" as Capture <<struct>> [[https://github.com/JasonLn0711/project_aura/blob/main/native/aura-capture/src/main.rs#L54]] {
  stopped
  eof
  frames
  error
  children
  thread
}
Init --> Connection : authenticated connection
Init --> Source : configured sources
Capture --> Manifest : durable spool coordinates
Capture --> Connection : stream / ACK / reconnect
@enduml
